win sits  while keeping his hands on his knees or  lacing his fingers together but the most  interesting thing about the actor's body  language was his eyes and how he used  them according to the expert the most  striking moments were when mr baldwin  looked george stephanopoulos in the eyes  and when he didn't eye contact henderson  says implies honesty meaning that  baldwin appeared truthful when he  referred to hutchins as a fantastic  person he also appeared truthful when he  recounted his memory of how the gun went  off when i cocked the gun can you see  that can you see that can you see that  and she says and then i let go of the  hammer of the gun and the gun goes off  on the other hand the actor's choice to  drop eye contact when claiming he didn't  observe any safety or security issues on  set as well as his denial that he feels  guilty about the situation indicates  there may be more to the story on those  specific points were costs being cut at  the expense of safety and security  in my opinion no because i did not  observe  any safety or security issues at all in  the time i was there the intention  behind baldwin's big interview seemed to  be to set the record straight but for  many viewers a question remains was he  being honest throughout this interview  according to henderson the answer is a  bit more complex than a simple yes or no  as henderson points out baldwin is an  actor and an extremely seasoned  interview guest as such he was very much  facing this issue on his home turf and  came into the interview prepared the  expert summed up the situation by saying  everyone wants to know if alec is lying  overall there was nothing which stood  out as a major red flag however alec was  also carefully controlling the narrative  by bringing up the feeling on set  multiple references to his family etc he  stuck to his script and his performance  it makes sense that baldwin would want  to maintain control in what was possibly  the most important interview of his  career especially when the first  interview he gave about the subject was  a more volatile affair on october 21st  baldwin shared details about the rust  shooting in a roadside interview with a  group of paparazzi in manchester vermont  in the statements he gave back then he  mentioned his interest in doing what he  could to help improve gun safety on film  sets and mentioned that he'd been in  touch with hutchins family both points  that he repeated in the new interview  with abc he also told the photographers  i've been ordered by the sheriff's  department in santa fe i can't answer  any questions about the investigation i  can't it's an active investigation  baldwin may have shared more information  with his interview but the central  question of who is responsible for the  shooting remains unresolved  someone is responsible  for what happened and i can't say who  that is but i know it's not me  check out one of our newest videos right  here plus even more looper videos about  the latest breaking news stories are  coming soon subscribe to our youtube  channel and hit the bell so you don't  miss a single one  [Music]
 

